('TCS', 'Data Analyst – TCS iON', 'TCS iON, TCS''s digital learning and assessment platform, is hiring Data Analysts in Chennai and Pune for its education analytics team to build usage, engagement, and learning-outcome dashboards used by 14 million learners and 650+ institutions across India. The role involves SQL queries on large learner datasets, Python-based reporting automation, and Tableau or Power BI dashboard development. Fresh graduates and candidates with up to one year of analytics experience are eligible.', 'Chennai, Pune, India', 'FULL_TIME', 'FRESHER', '4-7 LPA', 'https://nextstep.tcs.com/campus/', 40, '["SQL","Python","Tableau or Power BI","Data Analysis","Excel"]'::jsonb, '["Google Data Studio","EduTech Domain","Statistics"]'::jsonb, NULL, true),
('Accenture', 'DevOps New Associate', 'Accenture India is hiring DevOps New Associates for its cloud and infrastructure practice to support enterprise clients in building continuous integration, continuous delivery, and GitOps workflows on AWS, Azure, and GCP. The role suits candidates with 0–1 year of experience who have hands-on exposure to Jenkins, Kubernetes, and Terraform through internships or personal projects. Associates will receive structured certification support for AWS or Azure while working on live client engagements.', 'Bengaluru, Pune, Hyderabad, India', 'FULL_TIME', 'FRESHER', '4.5-6.5 LPA', 'https://www.accenture.com/in-en/careers', 40, '["Docker","Linux","Git","CI/CD Basics","Python or Shell Scripting"]'::jsonb, '["Kubernetes","Terraform","Cloud Certifications"]'::jsonb, NULL, true),
('Cognizant', 'Service Desk Analyst', 'Cognizant''s Digital Workplace practice is hiring Service Desk Analysts for PAN India locations through its off-campus drive to provide L1 and L2 IT support for global enterprise clients in financial services, healthcare, and retail. The role involves handling incident tickets via ServiceNow, troubleshooting Windows, Active Directory, and network connectivity issues, and escalating complex issues to senior technical teams. Fresh graduates across any discipline with strong communication skills and basic IT aptitude are eligible.', 'PAN India', 'FULL_TIME', 'FRESHER', '3-5 LPA', 'https://careers.cognizant.com/global/en/india-fresher-hiring', 40, '["Communication","ServiceNow Basics","Windows Troubleshooting","Networking Basics","ITIL Awareness"]'::jsonb, '["Active Directory","Ticketing Tools","Customer Service"]'::jsonb, '2026-07-30', true),
('Wipro', 'Associate Cloud Engineer', 'Wipro is hiring Associate Cloud Engineers for its cloud practice, targeting candidates with 0–1 year of experience in AWS or Azure who can support cloud migration projects for global retail and manufacturing clients. The role covers assisting with VPC configuration, IAM setup, S3 storage management, and EC2 workload monitoring under the supervision of senior cloud architects. Associates are expected to obtain AWS Cloud Practitioner certification within 90 days of joining.', 'Bengaluru, Chennai, India', 'FULL_TIME', 'FRESHER', '4-7 LPA', 'https://careers.wipro.com/', 40, '["AWS or Azure Basics","Linux","Networking","Python Scripting","Communication"]'::jsonb, '["AWS Cloud Practitioner","Terraform Basics","Docker"]'::jsonb, NULL, true),
('Zepto', 'Data Scientist – Supply Chain', 'Zepto''s supply chain analytics team is hiring junior Data Scientists in Mumbai to build demand forecasting models, inventory optimisation algorithms, and dark store replenishment systems for its 1,000+ quick commerce fulfilment centres across India. The role involves Python ML modelling using scikit-learn and Prophet, working with large-scale operational datasets, and iterating on model accuracy to improve Zepto''s 10-minute delivery promise. Candidates with strong quantitative skills and 0–2 years of experience are eligible.', 'Mumbai, India', 'FULL_TIME', 'JUNIOR', '16-26 LPA', 'https://www.zepto.in/careers', 70, '["Python","Machine Learning","SQL","Time Series Forecasting","Statistics"]'::jsonb, '["Prophet","Supply Chain Optimisation","Operations Research"]'::jsonb, NULL, true),
('Swiggy', 'DevOps Engineer', 'Swiggy''s infrastructure platform team is hiring DevOps Engineers in Bengaluru to manage and scale its Kubernetes-based microservices infrastructure handling millions of food delivery and Instamart orders daily. The role involves building GitOps workflows with Flux, maintaining AWS EKS clusters, improving CI/CD reliability, and building infrastructure self-service tools for Swiggy''s 1,000+ person engineering team. Candidates with 0–2 years of DevOps or SRE experience in a high-scale product environment are encouraged to apply.', 'Bengaluru, India', 'FULL_TIME', 'JUNIOR', '14-24 LPA', 'https://careers.swiggy.com/', 55, '["Kubernetes","Docker","AWS","Terraform","CI/CD"]'::jsonb, '["Flux or ArgoCD","Prometheus","Python"]'::jsonb, NULL, true),
('Meesho', 'Frontend Engineer', 'Meesho is hiring Frontend Engineers in Bengaluru to build the mobile web and app experiences for its social commerce platform used by millions of small sellers and buyers across India''s tier-2 and tier-3 cities. The role involves React and React Native development with a focus on performance for low-end devices and slow networks, building shareable product catalogs, and seller-facing listing management tools. Candidates with 0–2 years of frontend experience are eligible.', 'Bengaluru, India', 'FULL_TIME', 'JUNIOR', '14-22 LPA', 'https://careers.meesho.com/', 55, '["React","JavaScript","React Native","HTML/CSS","REST APIs"]'::jsonb, '["TypeScript","Performance Optimization","Redux"]'::jsonb, NULL, true);
